{"time": 1762175858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100527602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "这间宽敞的客房就是鸢尾庄园的仆人宿舍。墙边有八张床，大壁炉旁边有几张椅子围成半圆形地版放着，东墙的两面窗户之间还有一个书架"}
{"time": 1762175871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470508260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然较为简朴，但是每一张床垫都塞满了毛绒。房间的壁炉与厨房的大炉相连，"}
{"time": 1762175881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "283533085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=12C7AE720CB61FDB4F01B9769AC189DB.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSCxtg3Ym4wniYrm_RDkwEch2nXpxjx8wsg_woosKXm2ojWkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQp_p_egs06oZu5jzQG7kzq3oCxUGCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMDFKW18qReqVjiEavHamsrzkj4E0WQ2S5zX6JDz__gYTIahCvTQUZoxIXkvX0bsmcA,file_size=195057]"}
{"time": 1762175921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4855801", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是旁边的架子上有六个人头。三个放在角落里的，并且箱子已经被打开而且洗劫一空。房间里充斥着尸臭味以及食物腐烂的味道。"}
{"time": 1762175981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985346536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1098529435", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是旁边的架子上有六个人头。三个放在角落里的箱子已经被打开而且洗劫一空。房间里充斥着尸臭味以及食物腐烂的味道。"}
